stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> OPEN: Reported on unmanned lab [Student/Faculty]
  [*] --> ASSIGNED: Auto-assigned via BR-4 [System]

  OPEN --> ASSIGNED: Admin assigns assistant [Admin]
  OPEN --> ESCALATED: Unassigned SLA exceeded [Cron BR-5]
  OPEN --> CANCELLED: Student cancels [Student]
  OPEN --> REJECTED: Invalid complaint [Admin/Assistant]

  ASSIGNED --> ACCEPTED: Assistant acknowledges [Assistant]
  ASSIGNED --> ESCALATED: Unacknowledged SLA exceeded [Cron BR-5]
  ASSIGNED --> CANCELLED: Student cancels [Student]
  ASSIGNED --> REJECTED: Invalid complaint [Assistant]

  ACCEPTED --> IN_PROGRESS: Work started [Assistant]
  ACCEPTED --> ESCALATED: Bottleneck escalated [Assistant]
  ACCEPTED --> CANCELLED: Student cancels [Student]

  IN_PROGRESS --> ESCALATED: Part request or bottleneck [Assistant]
  IN_PROGRESS --> RESOLVED: Repair completed [Assistant]
  IN_PROGRESS --> CLOSED: Direct verified closure [Assistant BR-8]
  IN_PROGRESS --> CANCELLED: Student cancels [Student]

  ESCALATED --> AWAITING_PARTS: Authority approves part [Authority BR-6]
  ESCALATED --> IN_PROGRESS: Authority rejects part / reassigns [Authority]
  ESCALATED --> RESOLVED: Authority resolves [Authority]
  ESCALATED --> CLOSED: Authority closes [Authority BR-8]

  AWAITING_PARTS --> IN_PROGRESS: Part installed & inventory decremented [Assistant BR-7]

  RESOLVED --> CLOSED: Testing verified & closed [Assistant/Authority BR-8]
  RESOLVED --> IN_PROGRESS: Verification failed / reopened [Assistant]

